    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nWelcome to 38 Shanagarry - a wonderfully bright third floor apartment situated in this highly sought-after development in Milltown, Dublin 6. \n\nThe accommodation measures 39 square metres approx. and briefly comprises of an entrance hall leading to the bright living/dining room with dual aspect windows, a fitted kitchen with a range of integrated appliances and wooden storage units, a tiled bathroom, and a spacious double bedroom with built in storage. Residents of Shanagarry benefit from secure car parking accessed via a barrier and use of the beautifully manicured communal gardens which lead out to the Dodder River walkway. \n\nThe location of Shanagarry is in close proximity to Milltown Village, providing everything needed for daily living. Nearby surrounding villages, including Ranelagh, Rathmines and Dundrum, provide a wealth of boutiques, shops, bars, restaurants, and shopping centres. Conveniently positioned, the commuting distance to the city centre is already short, however, the Shanagarry complex further benefits from its proximity to the Green Luas line, the Milltown stop being only a three-minutes' walk away. All of this enhances the serviceability and suitability of this highly sought-after location."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nLiving Room/Dining Area - 3.27m x 5.36m\nDual aspect living room with wooden flooring, electric fireplace and electric radiator. Leading to the kitchen.\n\nKitchen - 2.90m x 1.73m\nTiled flooring and walls, wooden cabinetry and integrated appliances. Plumbed for a washing machine.\n\nBedroom - 2.77m x 3.94m\nCarpeted flooring, built-in wardrobe, electric radiator, and double-glazed windows.\n\nBathroom - 2.16m x 1.96m\nWith tiled flooring and walls, Twyford toilet, wash hand basin on plinth with shelf and shaving light, bathtub with Triton electric shower attachment, glass screen door, and extractor fan.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Secure gated development with parking</li><li>Close proximity to Milltown LUAS</li><li>Beautifully manicured communal gardens</li><li>Resident's access to Dodder walkway</ul>"
      },
      {
